  "description": "This receipt is issued by Golden Corral and identifies the restaurant as 7047 Arundel Mills Boulevard, Hanover, Maryland 21076. The header contains the restaurant location, contact telephone number, transaction date and time, customer name, transaction number, and indicates that the order was dine-in. The receipt records the purchase of two Holiday Adult Buffet meals and two Large Fountain Beverages, including Fanta Strawberry and Dr. Pepper. The financial section records the subtotal, applicable sales tax, and the final transaction total. The payment section confirms settlement using a Visa card. The receipt also promotes the MyCCExperience customer survey and provides the survey code together with instructions for participation. The overall layout is representative of a United States restaurant POS receipt, combining menu itemization, sales-tax reporting, electronic payment confirmation, and customer feedback information within a compact hospitality receipt format.",
